MODEL WATCH #52 — Thursday, September 3, 2026

1. LODESTONE-R2 TAKES THE REASONING LEAD
R2 on our 200-task reasoning set: 94.8, up from R1's 91.5 and clear of the field. Latency is the cost: median 41 seconds per task. Price $4 / $16 per million.

  Model          Reasoning   Median latency   Cost/task
  Lodestone-R2     94.8         41s            $0.052
  Pelagic 2.5      90.7         12s            $0.019
  Sable-3 (think)  88.1         15s            $0.024

2. QUILLON-M: PER-PAGE PRICING FOR DOCUMENT WORK
$0.004 per page, any token count. On our 500-page procurement set: 93.6 field accuracy, $2.00 total. The same set through a text model after OCR: 91.0 and $3.40. Per-page pricing is easier to forecast and, here, cheaper.

3. STRUCTURED OUTPUT: SCHEMA-VALID RATES
20,000 extraction calls with a strict JSON schema, schema-enforcement mode on where available:

  Sable-3         99.7%
  Pelagic 2.5     99.5%
  Quillon-L       99.4%
  Sable-3 Mini    98.9%
  Ferrite-8B      96.1%

Validate anyway. 0.3% of 50k daily calls is 150 bad records.

4. PRICE CHANGES THIS WEEK
  Sable-3 Mini: -20% (now $0.14 / $0.58)
  Vireo-2 embeddings: -50% (now $0.02 / M)
  Lodestone-R2: new, $4 / $16

